Options -Indexes
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
Header always set Referrer-Policy "no-referrer"
Header always set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'"
</IfModule>
# Hostinger setup: SetEnv APPLYPILOT_PRIVATE_DIR /absolute/account/path/applypilot-private
# Set only the private directory path here, NEVER API keys or encryption keys.
